<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Anna Pownall</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Droid+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&family=Tinos:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Tinos', serif;
            background: #faf9f6;
            color: #2a2a2a;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .uc-container {
            max-width: 560px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .uc-name {
            font-family: 'Droid Serif', serif;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            color: #555;
        }

        .uc-image {
            width: 70%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
        }

        .uc-text {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #3a3a3a;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .uc-text a {
            color: #2a2a2a;
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 3px;
        }

        .uc-text a:hover {
            color: #666;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #aaa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="uc-container">
        <p class="uc-name">Anna Pownall</p>

        <img
            class="uc-image"
            src="/uploads/artworks/img_69f8e6d7dd8ea7.63558423.jpg"
            alt="Sopla y Vuelo II"
        >

        <p class="uc-text">
            Hola, estoy construyendo mi nueva web.<br>
            Puedes ver mis ilustraciones en <a href="https://annapownall.bigcartel.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">annapownall.bigcartel.com</a> mientras la acabo.
        </p>

        <p class="uc-text">
            Y recuerda que del 26 al 28 de junio, estaré exponiendo en El Escorial&nbsp;:)
        </p>
    </div>

    <footer>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Anna Pownall</footer>
</body>
</html>
